# Plithos routing.
#
# Do NOT map /plithos_reader to /plithos_reader.html here. Cloudflare Pages
# already serves .html files at their extensionless path and redirects the
# .html form to it. Adding the reverse mapping creates an infinite loop.
#
# Only genuine aliases belong below: paths that are not real filenames.

/reader     /plithos_reader.html   200
/saints     /plithos_saints.html   200
/library    /plithos_reader.html   200
/calendar   /index.html            200
/prayers    /index.html            200
